From 04843a4b961048885c963d4a88cd5c609418e09a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James <james@localhost>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 09:49:17 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] sdl1: save slots with screenshots, on-screen messages and
 a slot picker

Quick save (modifier+Shift+0..9) now also writes SaveState<n>.bmp, a
screenshot taken at the same moment, and both quick save and quick load
show a short message over the picture.

F10/F11 open a picker with a thumbnail and time for each of the ten
slots and a large preview of the selected one. Shift+F10/F11 keep the
old file browser; Alt+F10/F11 keep the direct load/save.

save_state_save() now returns whether the state was written.
